  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Shadow Killer — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You have mastered your reversal, allowing you to heal instead of harm through shadows. When you make an attack roll, you can spend 2 cursed energy to target the shadow of a creature within your reach. On a hit, you stitch up their wounds through their shadow and the target regains hit points equal to your attack's damage roll + your Cursed Energy modifier. This healing increases to twice your Cursed Energy modifier at 6th level, and to thrice at 11th level.</p>",
